    ],
    "text": "As the e\ufb00ects of climate change continue to have a widespread impact on the environment, with the Australia bush\ufb01re crisis being the latest example, the \ufb01sh are no exception. The rising ocean water temper- atures have forced \ufb01sh to migrate to cooler waters in order to \ufb01nd more suitable habitats. Particularly of concern for Scotland are the forced migration of the Atlantic herring and Atlantic mackerel, two of the most valuable species for our \ufb01shing industry."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000025",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
