    ],
    "text": "Additionally, with the migration of the \ufb01sh into Iceland and Greenland\u2019s exclusive economic zones, these territories will gain a larger say on the \ufb01shing quota distribution having free reign to decrease the quota of \ufb01sh that Scotland is allowed to harvest. This may cause a trickle-down e\ufb00ect, limiting the quantity of \ufb01sh available to small \ufb01shing companies."
  },
