    ],
    "source_pages": [
      2
    ],
    "text": "With the realization that empty oceans and empty pockets will soon become a reality, it is more impor- tant than ever to prepare now for the future. In an e\ufb00ort to combat the forecasted loss in revenue, we suggest the following 4 strategies:"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000030",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "heading",
    "repairs": [],
    "section_id": "s0003",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0002-n0016-l0000"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      2
    ],
    "text": "1. Relocate northward to a better situated \ufb01sh-"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000031",
    "issues": [
      "hyphen_join_review"
    ],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
