      "p0002-n0018-l0002",
      "p0002-n0018-l0003"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      2
    ],
    "text": "With a large population south of Scotland that will only move northwards, haddock are a smart long-term harvest option."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000036",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "heading",
    "repairs": [],
