    "text": "If you\u2019re not already \ufb01lling your vessels\u2019 ca- pacities, upgrading to on-board refrigeration or faster motors can net an increase in revenue anywhere from 50% to over 1700%. These are only a few of the many options possible to recoup the \ufb01sh and the revenue. But without a doubt, the time is now to ensure no empty \ufb01shing nets in the future. Take action now!"
  },
